Subject: [PATCH] Fritchii v5: churn counters and the slow clear log (EDEN_UP_FRITCHII_CHURN, off by default)

Port of Frizti/Fritchii dcbd696438 (churn counters, EDEN_NX2_CHURN_LOG) and 55dcce4217 (slow clear
log), author Frizti with Claude Opus 5.5 (fable_answer_16 4). Measurement for fritchii-relocate.diff
and fritchii-fbindex.diff on the console.

With EDEN_UP_FRITCHII_CHURN=1 (counting and logging both off without it; one cached-bool check per
site):
- video_core/churn_counters.h: relaxed counters of images created/deleted, image views created/
  destroyed, Vulkan framebuffers created, buffer cache CreateBuffer (both insert sites) /
  DeleteBuffer / JoinOverlap and the bytes joins copy, staging buffers and their bytes, the
  allocator's device memory allocations and frees (VMA pDeviceMemoryCallbacks, only set with the
  switch), descriptor pools created. TextureCache::TickFrame logs "Churn (600 frames): ..." with the
  image count.
- RasterizerVulkan::Clear: a clear over 300 us is logged (at most 40 per 5 s) with the flush and
  render target time, the targets, and what was made while its targets were set up (counter deltas).

Deviations: fc40c591e9's per-join timers (rt_stats: walk/create/upload/delete/framebuffer ns,
framebuffers scanned/removed) are replaced by the counter deltas: their hooks sit in JoinImages,
GetFramebufferId and RemoveFramebuffers, which the relocation and framebuffer-index ports change.
Relocated/pooled counts are not here (relocation logs its own line; no EXP42 pool). Framebuffers are
counted in Vulkan Framebuffer::CreateFramebuffer. DeleteImage counts after its view loop, so its
generator-pinned accounting slice is untouched; the staging counter sits after the generator's
pinned CreateBuffer line.

Checks (fritchii-churn_checks.sh, log fritchii-churn.checks.log): git apply --check on
$R/Eglantine; 6 anchor skips before and after (same); generated copies that change:
vk_texture_cache_cost, vulkan-cache buffer_cache.h and texture_cache.h, vulkan_device,
vulkan_rasterizer, vulkan_staging_buffer_pool; -fsyntax-only of 11 TUs incl. those generated
copies, the Vulkan/OpenGL texture and buffer cache instantiations and vk_descriptor_pool: rc=0;
injected static_assert in churn_counters.h reported by 7 TUs, injected calls in each generated copy
reported. Expected cost: negligible (relaxed adds); nothing without the switch.

